        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: the band behind the album/song covered by Easy Star All-Stars on Radiodread; SubAudible Hum\n- Songs: \"Lucky\"; the title track covered on Radiodread\n- Albums: Radiodread\n\nFacts:\n- Easy Star All-Stars' album Radiodread is a cover version of Radiohead's album OK Computer, including the song \"OK Computer.\"\n- Radiohead recorded the song \"Lucky\" in the winter of 1995.\n- SubAudible Hum has often been compared to Radiohead.",
